OL,3,GNEWSANepal floods 'tragedy beyond
OL,4,Awords' - charity boss
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe chief executive of a
OL,7,FBerkshire-based charity coordinating
OL,8,Frelief efforts in Nepal has described
OL,9,Fthe flash floods as a "tragedy beyond
OL,10,Fwords".
OL,12,FThe floods struck on Wednesday after a
OL,13,Fglacier collapse triggered landslides
OL,14,Fand sent torrents of mud, water and
OL,15,Fdebris downstream.
OL,17,FThe number of people killed in Nepal
OL,18,Fhas risen to 579, according to the
OL,19,Flatest release by Nepal's National
OL,20,FDisaster Risk Reduction and Management
OL,21,FAuthority. Officials say that around
OL,22,F4,000 people have been rescued.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
